    "Metadata": {
        "Id": "58cafdfe-2616-42fc-87ed-06e961ffcac2",
        "Type": "usercreated",
        "Title": "Lethal Reimbursement",
        "Location": "LOCATION_COLOMBIA",
        "PublicId": "112444958952",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/colombia/scene_hippo.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository ea954042-2c56-4528-a724-7392fc5dd08f).Image",
        "Description": "47, we’ve received word that a well-known assassin, by the name of Henry Echevarr&#237;a, has booked a flight for later this afternoon, which takes him from his hometown of Santa Fortuna, Colombia and drops him somewhere in the Balkan region of Europe. We assume this is to eliminate a target. We’d like you to stop him, but in a fun way.\r\rYou see, he’s a gardener, and because of his knowledge of plants, he’s able to use that knowledge to brew some potent concoctions, of which he uses frequently in his assassination attempts. It’s time to use that knowledge against him, since as they say, knowledge is power. According to surveillance, Echevarr&#237;a is still in his home, but previous records show him enjoying his Friday nights at the local bar, so we may see him there soon.\r\rEliminate him and all who may have previously provided assistance.\r\rThis contract was made by Eclipse for the HITMAN Community Roadmap. Join our discord at https://hitman.community/discord for more information!",
